# Claude Code: share project config with the team, keep machine-local state out.
# `.claude/*` (not `.claude`) is required — git does not descend into an
# ignored directory, so the `!` re-inclusions below would never be evaluated.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/rules/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/agents/
